<Base title="Terms &amp; Conditions" description="Terms and SMS terms for CG Lumberjack's private SMS notifications.">
  <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: October 19, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      These terms apply to the text-message (SMS) notifications sent by <strong>CG Lumberjack</strong>, a
      sole proprietorship operated by Tom Mikota. The service is private and non-commercial: it is available
      only to the account owner and immediate family members who have personally asked to receive it.
    </p>

    <h2>SMS Terms</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Program:</strong> CG Lumberjack personal notifications. Messages are school-related alerts
        (for example, assignments needing attention, school events, and deadlines). Message frequency varies,
        typically one to a few messages per day.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Consent:</strong> You receive messages only if you personally asked to be included. Consent
        is not a condition of any purchase, and there is nothing to buy.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to stop receiving messages. You may
        receive one final message confirming your opt-out.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> or contact us at tmikota@gmail.com.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Costs:</strong> Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile plan.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Delivery:</strong> Delivery is not guaranteed. Carriers are not liable for delayed or
        undelivered messages.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Privacy:</strong> We do not sell or share your SMS opt-in data or personal information with
        third parties for marketing purposes. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>General</h2>
    <p>
      The service is provided as is, without warranties, and may change or end at any time. Questions:
      tmikota@gmail.com.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
